
<div class="app">
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="logo">📰 TruthCheck AI</div>
    <p class="tagline">Stop. Check. Verify.</p>
    <h1>Fake News Detection</h1>
    <p>Think before you share. Check the news before you believe it.</p>
    <span class="pill">AI News Analysis Demo</span>
  </header>

  <main class="panel">
    <label for="news">Paste a headline or news article</label>
    <textarea id="news" placeholder="Example: Scientists announce a new discovery. Paste the news you want to check here..." maxlength="10000"></textarea>

    <div class="actions">
      <button id="checkBtn">🔍 Check News</button>
      <button id="clearBtn" class="secondary">Clear</button>
    </div>

    <p id="counter">0 / 10000 characters</p>

    <div id="result" class="result" aria-live="polite">
      <div class="result-icon">🔎</div>
      <h2>Ready to investigate?</h2>
      <p>Your analysis will appear here.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="tips">
      <h2>🛡️ How to verify news</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Check the original source and author.</li>
        <li>Look for the same story in trusted news outlets.</li>
        <li>Verify the date, images, and supporting evidence.</li>
        <li>Be cautious of sensational headlines.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p class="disclaimer">
      Disclaimer: This is an educational demo, not a real AI fact-checker.
      Its classifications can be incorrect. Always verify information
      using reliable sources.
    </p>
  </main>

  <footer>TruthCheck AI · Verify before you share © 2026</footer>
</div>
